# Share Sheet

::summary
The doc share sheet, reached from the detail bar's Share and the ⋯ menu's Share link: copy link leading, then Send-in-Message targets, then a READ-ONLY access line pointing at the ⋯ menu's General access selector — access is NOT changed here (unified doc-menu parity).
::

::modal[name=share title="Share · tidepool — Spec" width=360 placement=centered dismissible=true]

